  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Daily closes from SSI iBoard chart history. 3,570 is the last close before HOSE moved FLC to suspension on 9 September 2022: 75.5% below the 25 March close.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giá đóng cửa từng ngày từ lịch sử biểu đồ SSI iBoard. 3.570 là giá cuối trước khi HOSE đình chỉ giao dịch FLC ngày 9/9/2022: thấp hơn 75,5% so với giá ngày 25/3.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10flcfall { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10flcfall-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10flcfall svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10flcfall text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10flcfall .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10flcfall .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10flcfall .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10flcfall .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10flcfall .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10flcfall .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10flcfall .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10flcfall .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10flcfall .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10flcfall .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10flcfall .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10flcfall .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10flcfall .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10flcfall .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10flcfall .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10flcfall .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10flcfall .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10flcfall .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10flcfall .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10flcfall .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10flcfall .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10flcfall .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10flcfall .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10flcfall .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10flcfall figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
